                                "sense_id": "38436a21-3bc2-3ea0-b6d7-bffdb7dbcbee",
                                "text": "1981, May 5 1718-PDT, Jim McGrath, Earliest Usenet use via Google Groups: fa.sf-lovers, said with a smile at an awards ceremony in the Pennsylvania state Capitol\nIt will be a shorter book and it will not start four million years ago."
